  ],
  "abstract": "I calculate optimistically asymptotic behaviors of the WRT $SU(2)$ invariants for the three-manifolds obtained from the ﬁgure-eight knot by p- surgeries with $p=0,1,2,$ $\\ldots,$ $10$ , from which one can extract volumes and the Chern-Simons invariants of these closed manifolds. I conjecture that this also holds for general closed three-manifolds.",
